1007
01:33:01,649 --> 01:33:06,539
different students. If you don’t have a
class yet, you can keep using a placement

1008
01:33:06,540 --> 01:33:10,635
class or a class you know well. Keep an
observation separate from an

1009
01:33:10,636 --> 01:33:15,464
interpretation, and a question separate
from a conclusion. If you don’t know how

1010
01:33:15,465 --> 01:33:20,233
a student experiences something, leave
room to find out through consultation. A

1011
01:33:20,234 --> 01:33:25,124
useful design brief connects what matters
