1374
02:03:40,760 --> 02:03:45,429
These six principles come from the
Family-School Partnerships Framework.

1375
02:03:45,430 --> 02:03:49,902
Let's connect each one to what we do.
First, parents and families are

1376
02:03:49,903 --> 02:03:54,177
